# Machine: MareNostrum 5 (BSC)

I am running on a MareNostrum 5 login node (alogin = ACC accelerated partition).

- Cluster: MN5 ACC (4x H100 64GB per node), BSC
- Scheduler: SLURM
- Account/project: ehpc1003
- Workspace: /gpfs/scratch/ehpc1003/<user>  (e.g. /gpfs/scratch/ehpc1003/vlk142020)
- Login nodes have NO outbound internet — transfer code/data via rsync from the Mac,
  or use the BSC transfer nodes
- Conda envs: <FILL IN>
- QoS / partitions in use: <FILL IN: e.g. acc_ehpc, acc_debug — verify with `sacctmgr show qos` / bsc_queues>
- SLURM logs convention: <FILL IN>
